WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.530
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.520
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:17.950
The Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament is under way, and the winner will be crowned the world's top idol.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.790
The First Stage was a contest between me and Rei-san.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:27.130
Rei-san wove her feelings for Elza-san into her magnificent performance, so I was worried about the outcome,

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:33.390
but in the end, the support of my fans was enough to push me through to the Final Stage.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.550
Now that we're finished, it's time for Elza-san and Mahiru-chan.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:47.440
We'll take a short recess for lunch and be back for the Second Stage with Elza Forte-san and Kasumi Mahiru-san.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.440
My stomach's growling now that I can relax.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.320
Mahiru's up next.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:57.360
Huh? Speaking of, I don't see Mahiru anywhere.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:59.830
She might be concentrating in the waiting room.

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:04.460
In that case, let's bring her a snack that'll fill her with energy for the afternoon.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.410
Sure!

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:15.470
<i>Now it's my turn to get serious.</i>

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>But...</i>

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.530
The café au lait here is delicious. {that's a weird cup, it's all short and wide. I guess that's how they can dip the crossoints in? didn't even know that was a thing, but there are images of exactly this on google}{it doesn't look weird to me}{it's huge, not a standard cafe cup}

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.400
Yes, isn't it just?

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.740
Perhaps I'll even take a refill.

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:05.660
You two, is this really the time to be lounging around?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:11.420
This tournament is essentially a referendum on Four Star Academy versus Venus Ark. {my justification is that the audience literally votes}{referendum is used to mean "measuring thing" in sports contexts even without voting}

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:13.920
Just because Nijino won the First Stage...

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.300
Are you really so worried about our precious successors?

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.630
Of course I am!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.640
Besides, after this is a one-on-one battle between Kasumi and Elza Forte.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.970
Don't you have any advice for her as her older sister?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:31.640
She'll be fine! I wholeheartedly believe in Mahiru.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.980
She's done a marvelous job walking her own path.

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.400
Either way...

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:41.650
Her radiance can't be outshined by the sun.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:46.530
The sun's radiance is in my hands.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:50.410
It is the ultimate power to outshine all other light.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.830
You're almost there, Elza.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:57.380
Yes, just a little more.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.550
Mahiru-chan?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:02.930
She's not here.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.510
Where could she be?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:08.560
I was so sure she'd be getting psyched before her performance.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.680
Psyched?

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.350
Tick tick tick tick...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.690
Ding dong!

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.350
I've got it!

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:18.190
Wow, it's been a while.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:33.210
We followed Mahiru-neesan just to cheer her on...

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.330
But the mood isn't exactly right.

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.460
This is legitimately crazy.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.880
She's tense... she's very tense. {I wish the word 'edgy' wasn't stolen by 2000s emos}{there's still to reclaim it when you will}

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.050
Futaba Aria-chan?!

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.380
Why are <i>you</i> here?!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:49.390
For the same reason as you! I was worried about Master.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.850
"Master"?

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.890
Yes!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:59.770
<i>Just... what am I doing?</i>

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:07.410
See, I told you!

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:10.080
My calculations were correct!

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:13.040
I guess your Tick Tick Ding Dongs are right sometimes.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.250
They're right <i>every</i> time!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.670
You really didn't hold back.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.630
I was trying to focus.

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:25.130
So, were you able to psyche yourself up?

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:27.720
Mahiru?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.180
I'm feeling kind of lost.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.430
About what?

00:05:31.810 --> 00:05:35.940
What reason do I have to stand on this stage?

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:36.850
Huh?

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:41.270
That's... It's obviously to win, isn't it?

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.440
What does it mean to win?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:46.070
What brought this on now of all times?

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:52.700
I was chasing after Onee-chan my entire first year at school.

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:58.420
After I beat her at the S4 Selection and inherited Romance Kiss and her place in S4,

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:03.340
I've been working hard not to bring shame to either one.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.670
Yeah, we can vouch for how much effort you've put in.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:11.640
You were even the first of us second-years to get your Star Wings.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:14.520
Wings, huh...

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:19.520
I learned something when we were at Venus Ark.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:24.320
Elza-san's aspirations are completely different from mine and Onee-chan's.{mezashite is a "different from" group}{I will never ever remember, so I leave it to you}

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:28.280
Knowing that, what's the point in competing?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.620
It's—

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:35.660
We're so sorry!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.200
What was that for?!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:41.040
I'm sorry! I pushed them a little too hard.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.080
Aria-chan?

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.550
And Susan, Amy, and Monica too? {Monica's in the middle, Amy on the left}{this could a tl note}

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:48.470
G-Good to see you again, Mahiru-neesan.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.010
What's going on?

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:54.260
They appear to have something to say to you.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.350
To me?

00:06:58.020 --> 00:07:00.060
Mahiru-neesan, um...

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:02.730
Well, uh...

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:05.480
What comes after two?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.490
Three?

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.110
It's three!

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.740
You're the one who taught us that, Mahiru-neesan!

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.710
"The most important thing to remember up on stage is to smile.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:24.630
It's okay if you mess up. All you need to do is embrace the stage."

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:31.800
You taught me too, Master. About the fun you can only have when you get serious.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:37.310
But does that mean that you can't have fun if you're not serious?

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:42.520
You look like you're bored out of your mind, Mahiru.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.770
I...

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.860
To be honest, I'm in a bit of a pickle. {I fucking knew this was coming, I felt a tingle}

00:07:54.700 --> 00:08:00.080
At the Final Stage, I'm not sure if I should cheer for Yume or for Mahiru.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.000
I'm not sure either.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:07.630
Yume-chan is my oldest friend, but I'm in Beauty Class with Mahiru-chan.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.260
I suppose in my case...

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:14.840
Perhaps I'll be chivalrous and wish you both the best.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:23.100
Go out and show everyone what it looks like when the two representatives of our year clash at the top.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.730
That would be a legitimately crazy stage!

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.400
Master!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.240
Thanks, everyone.

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.280
I need to get ready.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:38.990
Mahiru?

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.290
Mahiru-chan...

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.010
Mahiru-chan!

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:58.470
Yume.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:00.890
Listen...

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.140
I'll be waiting!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:06.980
You don't need to.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:07.810
Huh?

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.820
Because I'll catch up before you know it.

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:12.690
Mahiru-chan!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.700
Let's go!

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.950
Aikatsu!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:26.870
It's time to open the Second Stage with a performance from Elza Forte-san!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:36.340
<i>There are none who can stop me now.</i>

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:41.720
Dresses strengthen me!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.660
For I am perfect!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.700
She's amazing every time.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:53.540
Her radiance is truly deserving to bear the name of the Sun Dress.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.830
It's okay. You don't need to worry.

00:12:56.830 --> 00:13:03.720
Mahiru-chan lives up to her name too, as the bright daylight that gently embraces us all from above. {I can't remove this part}

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.300
You said it!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.680
You have a way with words, Yume.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.850
Yeah, let's see it!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.810
The radiance of Mahiru's sky!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:17.980
Up next is Kasumi Mahiru-san's performance!

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:24.990
<i>Blinded by the light of the sun, I was only looking at Elza-san.</i>

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:31.370
<i>But my true goal shines far beyond the sun...</i>

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.500
<i>The first star!</i>

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:40.630
<i>I want to compete with Yume after all the Aikatsu we've done together!</i>

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:46.010
Kasumi Mahiru, like a radiant light!

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.990
Bloom and flourish, my dress!

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.490
You're the best, Mahiru-neesan!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:01.450
I can't stop crying!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:05.540
It's crazy—no, that stage was legit cray!

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:08.960
The radiance of Mahiru's sky was dazzling!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:13.220
Yes! That was her greatest performance ever, bar none!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:15.590
You're amazing, Mahiru-chan!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.640
Now then, both idols have had their turn!

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:26.940
Let's tally up the votes!

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.990
God! God of Aikatsu!

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:46.160
Please smile down upon my sister!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:51.800
Please win, Kasumi!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:03.100
Oh, could it be?!{why would they do this}{she stuffed the ballots! tl note: I'm joking}

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.390
There we have it!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:13.150
The victor of the Second Stage is Elza Forte-san!

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.150
Elza-san.

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:19.530
I learned a lot.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.780
Thank you.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:28.170
And what a fabulous contest it was!

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:34.500
The Final Stage will be stood upon by Nijino Yume-san and Elza Forte-san!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.260
Everyone, look forward to it!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:56.650
Mahiru!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.570
Girls...

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:03.620
Um, uh...

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:07.200
That was so much fun!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.960
Oh, is this for me? Thanks!

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.210
I'm starving after all that singing.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.590
A bagel? It looks delicious! {honestly expected chocolate muffins}

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.590
Um, are you... okay?

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:24.350
We're only in our second year.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:28.850
There'll be plenty more chances to compete with Yume in S4 after this.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:31.100
Th-That's true too!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.310
I wouldn't be so sure.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:33.860
Hey, Rola!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:38.190
After all, nobody knows how the next S4 will turn out.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:39.690
Right, Koharu?

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.360
Huh?! Um...

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:47.290
Actually, I've decided to do everything I can to be the next Beauty Class S4 member.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.870
K-Kyoharu?!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:53.710
I finally got to perform with Yume-chan, and I'm more confident in myself now.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:58.300
I want to wear a dress I designed myself and have my very own stage.

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.300
Koharu-chan!

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.050
Those words...

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:05.140
Can I take them as a declaration of rivalry?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.180
Of course!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.720
Got it.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.930
I won't wait for you.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.230
Okay! I'll catch up soon!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.810
Okay, everyone in!

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.650
Here we go!

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.440
Aikatsu!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.200
Mahiru-neesan...

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:25.700
What an exceptional smile...

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:33.170
Yes! The look on Master's face after a serious performance is lovely! It's very lovely!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.710
The Earth was formed 4.6 billion years ago!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:39.050
I'm so glad I was born in the same era as Mahiru!

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.420
I'm so glad I'm Kasumi Mahiru's brother!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:45.720
And... that was well said, Koharu-chan!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.270
Mahiru!

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.350
Onee-chan.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:20:59.230
Sorry.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:08.240
I succeeded you in S4 and inherited 
Romance Kiss, and I've been trying my best...

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:12.370
But in the very end, I lost.

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:17.290
Are you frustrated with your loss?

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:18.500
A little.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.750
I see.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:26.380
I couldn't tell you this before, but after I lost during last year's S4 Selection,

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:29.930
I was actually a little bit frustrated too.

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:39.270
Come on, you were too?

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:42.190
I guess we really are sisters.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:43.030
Yep!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:47.910
Hey, Onee-chan. Do you want to hang out in my room and talk all night?

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:50.280
Like about today and about the future too.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:54.790
Of course! That's exactly why I called you here.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.500
Yay!

00:21:58.830 --> 00:22:00.630
Oh, and also!

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:07.050
Do you think we can incorporate the radiance of the Sun Dress into Romance Kiss somehow?

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:08.970
My, that sounds wonderful.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.300
But it won't fit without some work.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:15.180
I know! That's why I'm asking for your advice.

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:17.350
You've got it, and as much as you need.

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:20.940
Oh, and get this! Koharu said something great!

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:21.820
Go on.

00:22:21.820 --> 00:22:23.230
What do you think she said?

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:24.940
Let me think...

00:23:56.120 --> 00:24:01.460
Because I was serious in trying to win wearing our Romance Kiss, I'm frustrated that I lost.

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:05.960
I believe that your Aikatsu will make a fresh start here.

00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:08.880
Yeah! I want to shine even brighter!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:14.090
Once I become the best in the world, I will retire from being an idol.

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:16.140
That's definitely baa!

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:18.600
Yume! Please win and stop Elza!

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.430
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:21.680
Lonely Sun.

00:24:21.680 --> 00:24:24.190
Become the first-star idol!
